.SH NAME
cw \- cw history-pane
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cw
\fI\,history-pane \/\fR[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IP
Show per\-pane command history for the current pane.
.IP
Examples:
.TP
cw history\-pane
last 20 commands in this pane
.TP
cw history\-pane \fB\-n\fR 50
last 50 commands
.TP
cw history\-pane \fB\-\-file\fR
show history file path
.TP
cw history\-pane \fB\-\-cat\fR
show raw file contents
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-file\fR
Show history file path for current pane.
.TP
\fB\-\-cat\fR
Show contents of history file.
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR INTEGER
Number of commands to show.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
